minilm-l6-v2-quantized.onnx and tokenizer.json: all-MiniLM-L6-v2 by sentence-transformers
(https://huggingface.co/sentence-transformers/all-MiniLM-L6-v2), int8 ONNX build from Xenova/all-MiniLM-L6-v2.
